---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../../../site.config';
---
<Base title={`Privacy | ${site.name}`} description={`What ${site.name} collects: no cookies, no analytics, and form submissions sent by email only.`} path="/privacy/" crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy', url: '/privacy/' }]}>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="lead">{site.name} sets no cookies and runs no analytics or advertising scripts.</p>
  <h2>Our forms</h2>
  <p>When you send a form, your answers are emailed to us and not stored on this website. We use your own name and email only to reply, and to invoice you for a land ad or Verified listing. They are never published.</p>
  <p>On a land ad, the seller name, phone and email you enter under “How buyers reach you” are published on the ad so buyers can contact you, and are removed when the ad ends. On a land agent listing, only the business details you send may appear.</p>
  <p>The forms use Cloudflare Turnstile to block spam, which may process your IP address and browser details under Cloudflare’s privacy policy.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare, which processes standard request logs to deliver pages and stop abuse.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>To have a submission or ad deleted, use <a href="/sell-your-land/">the land form</a> or <a href="/add-your-business/">the agent form</a> and say so in the description.</p>
</Base>
